(Heyo Cloud Security, Compliance and Privacy Whitepaper) ' 
() ' 
(1. SOC 2 Type II Certification) ' 
(Heyo Cloud is fully SOC 2 Type II certified by an independent AICPA-accredited auditor.) ' 
(Our annual audit report covers Security, Confidentiality, and Availability trust service criteria.) ' 
(Customers on Enterprise plans can request our current SOC 2 report under NDA via security@heyo.so.) ' 
() ' 
(2. Data Encryption Standards) ' 
(Data in Transit: All incoming and outgoing network traffic is encrypted using TLS 1.3 with AES-256 GCM.) ' 
(Data at Rest: All visitor messages, conversation logs, and uploaded knowledge base documents) ' 
(are stored in Neon Postgres and Neon Object Storage with AES-256 disk-level encryption.) ' 
() ' 
(3. GDPR & CCPA Compliance) ' 
(Heyo acts as a Data Processor under GDPR. Workspace owners are Data Controllers.) ' 
(We provide automated Data Subject Request \(DSR\) workflows for right-to-be-forgotten and data export.) ' 
(Visitor conversation histories are automatically retained for 90 days by default, customizable in settings.) ' 
() ' 
(4. Incident Response & 24/7 Security Operations) ' 
(Our dedicated security operations center monitors system telemetry around the clock.) ' 
(In the event of a confirmed security incident, Heyo notifies affected workspace owners within 24 hours.) ' 
ET
